# quest/002/JobNin350_00214 — «Killer Combinations» · in play order
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: ru\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"X-Game-Version: 2026.09.15.0000.0000\n"
"X-Source-Language: en\n"

#. ja: ツバメは、冒険者に感心をしているようだ。
#. de: Tsubame scheint dein Kommen noch nicht bemerkt zu haben.
#. fr: Tsubame vous regarde avec attention et semble avoir quelque chose à vous dire.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/002/JobNin350_00214:TEXT_JOBNIN350_00214_SEQ_00:1"
msgid "Tsubame appears quite pleased with your progress."
msgstr ""

#. ja: オボロが冒険者のことを待っているらしい。船着場の平屋の中にいる「オボロ」と話そう。
#. de: Oboro erwartet dich bereits. Betritt das Bootshaus, um deine Unterweisung fortzuführen.
#. fr: D'après Tsubame, Oboro aurait quelque chose d'important à vous montrer. Allez le retrouver dans l'entrepôt.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/002/JobNin350_00214:TEXT_JOBNIN350_00214_SEQ_01:1"
msgid "Tsubame is deeply impressed at the aptitude and affinity you have shown for the way of the shinobi, and she muses that your skills might one day rival her own. Now, the time has come to receive your next lesson. Enter the storehouse and speak with Oboro."
msgstr ""

#. ja: オボロから新たな印、「地の印」を教えてもらった。修行の説明を聞くため、再度オボロに話しかけよう。
#. de: Oboro hat dir eine neue Mudra beigebracht: „Chi“, die Handgeste der Erde. Sprich noch einmal mit ihm, um mehr zu erfahren.
#. fr: Oboro vous a enseigné un nouveau signe mudrâ, “Chi”. Adressez-vous de nouveau à lui pour découvrir comment en tirer le meilleur parti au combat.
#. kind: journal
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/002/JobNin350_00214:TEXT_JOBNIN350_00214_SEQ_02:1"
msgid "After proudly displaying his own mastery of a challenging technique─the common Eorzean bow─Oboro teaches you your second mudra. Known as <i>Chi</i> in the Doman tongue, this gesture will allow you to call forth the power of the earth itself. When you are prepared to learn how to wield it in battle, speak with Oboro once more."
msgstr ""

#. ja: オボロと話す
#. de: Im Bootshaus mit Oboro sprechen
#. fr: Parler à Oboro
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/002/JobNin350_00214:TEXT_JOBNIN350_00214_TODO_00:1"
msgid "Speak with Oboro."
msgstr ""

#. ja: おや、<split " " 1><string $gs1></split>様。<br>ふふふ、忍びの者として、たくましくなられましたね！
#. de: Huch, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>! Ich hab dich gar nicht kommen hören! Wie es sich für <if $gn4>eine echte Shinobi<else>einen echten Shinobi</if> gehört.
#. fr: <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>Bonsoir<else>Bonjour</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>Bonjour<else>Bonsoir</if></if>, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>. Je vois que vous vous êtes considérablement amélioré<if $gn4>e</if> depuis notre dernière rencontre.
#. speaker: TSUBAME
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/002/JobNin350_00214:TEXT_JOBNIN350_00214_TSUBAME_000_000:1"
msgid "<split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>! Why, I did not even hear your footsteps as you approached. You are becoming more and more the shinobi with each day."
msgstr ""

#. ja: オボロ様が平屋でお待ちです。<br>どうぞ、お入りください。
#. de: Meister Oboro erwartet dich bereits. Tritt ein!
#. fr: Il me semble qu'Oboro a quelque chose d'important à vous montrer. Il vous attend à l'intérieur de l'entrepôt, ne le faites pas patienter davantage<nbsp>!
#. speaker: TSUBAME
msgctxt "quest/002/JobNin350_00214:TEXT_JOBNIN350_00214_TSUBAME_000_001:1"
msgid "Oboro has been awaiting your return. Please, enter."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 心を無にすれば……礼もうまくいくはず……。
#. de: Wie war das noch mal? Schaut man sich beim Verbeugen in die Augen oder nicht ...?
#. fr: Bien droit, le bras souple... Ça alors, je me demande bien pourquoi les Éorzéens ont adopté un salut si compliqué à exécuter<nbsp>!
#. speaker: OBORO
msgctxt "quest/002/JobNin350_00214:TEXT_JOBNIN350_00214_OBORO_000_005:1"
msgid "Hand before the torso, bend at the hips... Presence of mind, presence of mind..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ふふふ、たくましくなられましたね！<br>私なんて、すぐに抜かされてしまいそうです。
#. de: Aus dir wird noch <if $gn4>eine ganz leise tretende Shinobi<else>ein ganz leise tretender Shinobi</if>, davon bin ich überzeugt.
#. fr: Vous progressez si rapidement dans la voie du ninja... Je sens que vous n'allez pas tarder à me surpasser<nbsp>!
#. speaker: TSUBAME
msgctxt "quest/002/JobNin350_00214:TEXT_JOBNIN350_00214_TSUBAME_000_010:1"
msgid "The ease with which you have grasped the basics of our art is impressive, to say the least. Neglect not your training, and I can foresee the day when your skills rival my own."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>……腕を上げたようだな。<br>しかし、成長したのは、お主だけではござらぬぞ。
#. de: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>! Ich habe gar nicht bemerkt, wie du reingekommen bist. Ich muss sagen, du machst gute Fortschritte. Aber nicht nur du ...
#. fr: Ah, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split><nbsp>! Vous me semblez... différent<if $gn4>e</if>. Mais ne croyez pas que vous êtes <if $gn4>la seule<else>le seul</if> à avoir progressé<nbsp>!
#. speaker: OBORO
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/002/JobNin350_00214:TEXT_JOBNIN350_00214_OBORO_000_020:1"
msgid "Ah, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>. It is clear from the manner in which you carry yourself that you have been most diligent in your training."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 見よ、この自然な礼を……。<br>日々の鍛錬を積んだ成果だ。<br>……さて、今度は、我々が修行を課す番だな。
#. de: Ich habe an meiner Verbeugung gearbeitet, wie du siehst. Nicht schlecht, oder? Aber genug davon, es ist Zeit für deine Unterweisung.
#. fr: Que dites-vous de cette révérence<nbsp>? Le naturel même, n'est-ce pas<nbsp>? C'est le fruit de centaines d'heures d'en<shy>traî<shy>ne<shy>ment intensif<nbsp>!
#. speaker: OBORO
msgctxt "quest/002/JobNin350_00214:TEXT_JOBNIN350_00214_OBORO_000_021:1"
msgid "But you are not the only one who has mastered the technique imparted to you. Behold my Eorzean bow, perfect in balance and form!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: それでは、お主に新たな「印」……「地の印」を教える。<br>これは、大地に満ちるエーテルを結ぶ「印」だ。<br>後ほど、実戦を交えた修行を行うとしよう。
#. de: Heute bringe ich dir eine neue Mudra bei: „Chi“, die Handgeste der Erde. Und Gelegenheit, sie zu üben, sollst du auch erhalten.
#. fr: ... Bon, l'heure est venue de vous enseigner un nouveau signe de mains rituel. Voici la mudrâ “Chi”, qui vous permettra de canaliser l'énergie qui circule dans la terre. Mémorisez-la et dites-moi lorsque vous serez prêt<if $gn4>e</if> à passer à la pratique.
#. speaker: OBORO
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/002/JobNin350_00214:TEXT_JOBNIN350_00214_OBORO_000_022:1"
msgid "...Ahem. Now, it is time for your next lesson. Watch carefully my hands, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>. With this mudra, the shinobi can summon the energies of the earth─<i>Chi</i>, in our tongue. Etch its form in your mind, and I shall show you how to employ it in battle."
msgstr ""
